# The corner at a window's foot that sizes it (design 11.1), for tools/ui_run.py: the
# pointer over it takes the shape of the hand holding (WM_PT_GRIP) and the ordinary one
# off it; a double press on it makes the window the screen's size (全画面表示) and a
# second puts it back where it stood. A window of the desktop's own (原紙箱, 893,35 to
# 1093,635) and the window of a process (予定表, 100,100 to 920,738), each with Ctrl+L
# as well, which goes the same way: one put full by the corner put back by Ctrl+L, and
# the other way round. The screen is 1280x800, the message line under 780.
# The hand holding is laid with its point 4 down from its top, its knuckles black 9 to
# the right of the point and 4 above it; the ordinary hand points with its top left.
waitwin 原紙箱
win 原紙箱
want ok 893 35 1093 635
move 1000 300
wait 300
# over the corner: the hand holding
move 1088 630
wait 400
pixel 1097 626 000000
shot grip_on_desk
# along the foot, off the corner: the ordinary hand, nothing black where the knuckles were
move 1060 630
wait 400
pixel 1069 626 e0e0e0
pixel 1060 630 000000
shot grip_off_desk
# and back over it
move 1088 630
wait 400
pixel 1097 626 000000
# a double press on the corner: 全画面表示, and the corner of the screen's size puts it back
dclick 1088 630
wait 800
win 原紙箱
want ok 0 0 1280 780
shot grip_full_desk
dclick 1275 775
wait 800
win 原紙箱
want ok 893 35 1093 635
shot grip_back_desk
# full by the corner, back by Ctrl+L
dclick 1088 630
wait 800
win 原紙箱
want ok 0 0 1280 780
key 0F 01
wait 800
win 原紙箱
want ok 893 35 1093 635
# the window of a process
open 019d6f00-1a2b-7c3d-8e4f-a1b2c3d4e5f6
expect calendar: ready
wait 800
win 予定表
want ok 100 100 920 738
move 600 400
wait 300
move 915 733
wait 400
pixel 924 729 000000
shot grip_on_proc
move 880 733
wait 400
pixelnot 889 729 000000
move 915 733
wait 400
# full by the corner, back by Ctrl+L: the program asks the desktop, which kept where it stood
dclick 915 733
wait 1000
win 予定表
want ok 0 0 1280 780
shot grip_full_proc
logmark
key 0F 01
expectsince calendar: fullscreen off
wait 1000
win 予定表
want ok 100 100 920 738
# full by Ctrl+L, back by the corner
logmark
key 0F 01
expectsince calendar: fullscreen on
wait 1000
win 予定表
want ok 0 0 1280 780
dclick 1275 775
wait 1000
win 予定表
want ok 100 100 920 738
shot grip_back_proc
# and by the corner twice more
dclick 915 733
wait 1000
win 予定表
want ok 0 0 1280 780
dclick 1275 775
wait 1000
win 予定表
want ok 100 100 920 738
absent !OACV!
